{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>נבוב לוחות.</b> That it be hollow inside, and light to carry. It is placed inside the מכבר (grate), and the edge of the מכבר reaches to the middle of the altar. When Israel encamp, they fill the hollow of the boards with earth and offer sacrifices on that earth. When they journey, they lift the altar by the staves fixed in the edge of the מכבר, and the earth falls out through the holes in the rim of the מכבר, which was made like the work of a net. And when they rest, they fill it again."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:40.270942169Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}